        <button
          type="button"
          id="itp-add-more-btn"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 transition cursor-pointer"
        >
          + Add More Images
        </button>
      </div>

      <div id="itp-file-list" class="space-y-2"></div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 pt-1">
        <span>Total images: <strong id="itp-total-count" class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">0</strong></span>
        <span>Total file size: <strong id="itp-total-size" class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">0 B</strong></span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 sm:gap-3 pt-2">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="itp-create-btn"
          disabled
          class="flex-1 sm:flex-none inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 active:scale-95 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow transition cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
          </svg>
          Convert & Merge Images to PDF
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="itp-clear-btn"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 transition cursor-pointer"
        >
          Clear All
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── PROGRESS / STATUS ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div id="itp-status-section" class="hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 sm:p-5" role="status">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span id="itp-status-icon" class="text-2xl shrink-0"></span>
        <div class="space-y-1 min-w-0">
          <p id="itp-status-title" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white"></p>
          <div id="itp-status-body" class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── DOWNLOAD BUTTON AREA ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div id="itp-download-section" class="hidden"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       COMPREHENSIVE SEO CONTENT SECTION (800+ WORDS)
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <Fragment slot="content">
    <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">

      <!-- SECTION 1: Introduction & Main Keyword Focus -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          Images to PDF Converter: Convert Images to PDF Online Free
        </h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
          Converting pictures into an organized, shareable document is an everyday requirement for students, professionals, and businesses. Our modern <strong>images to pdf converter</strong> offers the fastest, most secure way to <strong>convert images to pdf</strong> right inside your web browser. Whether you need to compile scanned identity documents, consolidate receipts for tax deductions, create an artistic portfolio, or package presentation slides, you can <strong>merge images to pdf</strong> in seconds without downloading clunky desktop software or subscribing to expensive tools.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Unlike traditional online file converters that transfer your sensitive photos to remote servers, our <strong>images to PDF</strong> engine operates 100% locally. Using modern browser standards and client-side processing, every JPG, PNG, WebP, and GIF file is compiled into your PDF on your device's CPU. This guarantees instant conversion speeds, complete offline privacy, and zero data leakage.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 2: Why Convert Images to PDF? Core Benefits Grid -->
