            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Combine multiple receipts, invoices, textbook pages, or contract photos into one neatly numbered document rather than sending twenty scattered photo attachments.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-2 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-2xl">🔒</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Guaranteed Privacy</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              No cloud storage, no server logs, and zero tracking. Your private photos, passport copies, and bank statements are processed in browser memory and discarded immediately.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-2 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-2xl">🎯</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Lossless Visual Quality</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Every graphic is rendered at full original resolution. Clean vector edges, high-DPI scans, and fine document typography remain sharp and readable when printed or zoomed.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-2 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-2xl">📱</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Universal Compatibility</h3>
