            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-2 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-2xl">🔄</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Flexible Custom Sequencing</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
